---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="RunFps privacy policy — we collect no personal data. All calculations run in your browser.">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-6">
    <div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-dark-ink tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray mt-1">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">We collect no personal data. All calculations, analysis, and optimizations run entirely in your browser. Nothing is sent to our servers.</p>

    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-dark-ink mb-1">Third-Party Services</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">We use Google AdSense for ads. AdSense may use cookies to serve relevant ads. You can opt out at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-ink dark:text-dark-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-ember transition-colors duration-120">Google Ad Settings</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-dark-ink mb-1">Local Storage</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">We use localStorage to remember your dark mode preference. This stays on your device.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-dark-ink mb-1">No Tracking</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">No analytics, no tracking pixels, no fingerprinting. The only third-party code is AdSense.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-dark-ink mb-1">No User Accounts</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">There's nothing to sign up for and nothing to delete. We don't store anything about you.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hello@runfps.com" class="text-ink dark:text-dark-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-ember transition-colors duration-120">hello@runfps.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
